$$
\begin{align*}
\text{Overtime hours} &= 44-38 = 6\\
\text{Equivalent normal hours} &= 38+(6\times1.5)=47\\
\text{Normal hourly rate} &= \frac{1042.32}{38}\\
\text{Total pay} &= \frac{1042.32}{38}\times47\\
&=\$1289.19\text{ (nearest cent)}
\end{align*}
$$

Replace the Saturday earnings with weekday earnings.
$$\begin{align*}
\text{Saturday pay} &= 18\times6\times1.5=\$162\\
\text{Extra weekday hours} &= \frac{162}{18}\\
\text{Extra weekday hours} &= 9\text{ h}
\end{align*}$$

